    <icon:associationBasis>Curator capability-to-process planning link, 2026-10-17, based on MIT.nano and model documentation. Not article-reported apparatus or validated configuration. Optional grid vitrification before TEM verification of hydrated dispersions. Selecting this class requires a cryo-TEM configuration in the M39 verification slot. Not bulk freezing or freeze drying.</icon:associationBasis>
    <icon:reviewDate>2026-10-17</icon:reviewDate>
    <icon:notes>Full freezer is catalog 37000; environmental chamber 37457 and forceps 37458 are accessories. Accessory/consumable prices are excluded from machine purchase price. Grid/microsample plunge-freezer scope; not a bulk high-pressure freezer.</icon:notes>
