    <icon:verificationBasis>independent_research_evidence</icon:verificationBasis>
    <icon:verificationNotes>Bruker announced acquisition of Berlin-based JPK Instruments AG on July 12, 2018. Bruker continues to document the JPK BioAFM/NanoWizard product line. Keep the source-era JPK Instruments attribution on NanoWizard II, with a Bruker successor note. Acquisition is not grounds for marking the research brand illegitimate or defunct. No specific NanoWizard II replacement claim verified here. Official brand identity and model-specific primary-paper research use checked separately; no adoption-prevalence claim.</icon:verificationNotes>
    <icon:companyStatusNote>Parent / corporate successor: Bruker Corporation. Keep the source-era JPK Instruments attribution on NanoWizard II, with a Bruker successor note. Acquisition is not grounds for marking the research brand illegitimate or defunct. No specific NanoWizard II replacement claim verified here.</icon:companyStatusNote>
    <icon:reviewDate>2026-10-17</icon:reviewDate>
    <schema:url rdf:resource="https://www.bruker.com/en/news-and-events/news/2018/bruker-announces-acquisition-of-jpk-instruments.html"/>
