    <icon:inputDescription>Materials/workload: Samples in approved tubes/containers; compatible rotor/buckets and run settings.
Documented parameters/utilities: Speed setting/range (rpm), Temperature setting/range (°C).
Interfaces named: LAN, USB. Pin directions and permitted commands require the interface section.
Other per-input states/guards: not established by this functional summary.
Sources: H PDF pp. 1, 21, 98.</icon:inputDescription>
    <icon:outputDescription>Centrifuged samples/fractions; actual separation and recovery are sample-dependent.
Source-listed channels/measurands: speed, temperature, time, imbalance.
Status terms explicitly described: idle, cooling, stopped.
Other output-state/pin mappings: not established by this functional summary.
Sources: H PDF pp. 1, 21, 98.</icon:outputDescription>
    <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>RCF; rpm; °C
Sources: H PDF pp. 15, 17, 18, 21, 38, 68, 72, 76 et seq..</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
