    <icon:verificationNotes>Official company site states establishment in 1994 and identifies a continuing range of electrochemical instrumentation for research and teaching. Shanghai Chenhua's site describes itself as the authorized China distributor of the US CH Instruments brand. Do not silently merge the Shanghai distributor's legal identity into the US manufacturer. Exact article attribution can retain the reported supplier name alongside normalized make. Official brand identity and model-specific primary-paper research use checked separately; no adoption-prevalence claim.</icon:verificationNotes>
