    <icon:reviewDate>2026-10-18</icon:reviewDate>
    <icon:notes>Manufacturer product evidence; no operating manual located. 2026-10-18 review: Universal mask alignment platform with soft UV-NIL up to 150 mm and SmartNIL up to 100 mm; ≤40 nm resolution depends on process/template. Same platform family as standard EVG620 NT, not a separate independently photographed hardware model. Official NIL-page photograph is an open platform labelled EVG620; treat as manufacturer-selected EVG620 NT platform image, not direct visual proof of SmartNIL tooling. Numeric purchase price and exact operating manual were not established. Manufacturer capabilities and catalogue options are not validated recipe conditions.</icon:notes>
