    <icon:manualMatchStatus>manufacturer_specification</icon:manualMatchStatus>
    <icon:modelEvidenceStatus>documented</icon:modelEvidenceStatus>
    <icon:imageScope>Manufacturer product image: Model platform/configuration photo; installed NIL tooling cannot be verified visually. See configuration notes. Universal mask alignment platform with soft UV-NIL up to 150 mm and SmartNIL up to 100 mm; ≤40 nm resolution depends on process/template. Same platform family as standard EVG620 NT, not a separate independently photographed hardware model. Official NIL-page photograph is an open platform labelled EVG620; treat as manufacturer-selected EVG620 NT platform image, not direct visual proof of SmartNIL tooling.</icon:imageScope>
    <icon:mediaCheckedDate>2026-10-18</icon:mediaCheckedDate>
    <icon:productPageScope>Universal mask alignment platform with soft UV-NIL up to 150 mm and SmartNIL up to 100 mm; ≤40 nm resolution depends on process/template. Configuration-specific capabilities, not an installed-system audit.</icon:productPageScope>
