    <icon:notes>TAS atom brochure pages 2 and 4 identify the 60 mm aperture variant. Neutral-atom source for a compatible host, distinct from the ion-source series. P19 relevance is specifically an optional nitride-PLD configuration; not apparatus from the cited P19 experiment. P46 relevance does not establish a replacement for UCLA installed hardware. Manufacturer operating envelopes are not recipe setpoints. Public purchase price and exact-model operating manual were not published in this bounded review. No documented successor relationship or newest-generation claim. No make/model match in the user-designated Purdue list; generic PVD wording is not asset identity.</icon:notes>
