  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/M51-06">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/ontology#InputOutputProfile"/>
    <dct:identifier>M51-06</dct:identifier>
    <rdfs:label>TSI Nano DMA 3085A — input/output metadata</rdfs:label>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/equipment_io.csv"/>
    <icon:inputDescription>Materials/workload: Aerosol feed and sheath/carrier flow; classification settings.
Documented parameters/utilities: Flow setting/range (L/min), Gas/air supply (L/min), Temperature setting/range (K; °C), Pressure setting/range (kPa).
Interfaces named: Ethernet, LAN, RS-232, USB. Pin directions and permitted commands require the interface section.
Source-described sample/feed form: gas stream.
Other per-input states/guards: not established by this functional summary.
Sources: H PDF pp. 1, 29, 64, 114.</icon:inputDescription>
    <icon:outputDescription>Mobility-selected aerosol; size-distribution data require a documented measuring-system configuration.
