    <icon:reviewDate>2026-10-18</icon:reviewDate>
    <icon:notes>No make/model match to the user-designated Purdue list. Required tooling/modules, wafer size, resist/developer, geometry and substrate compatibility must be reviewed. Thermal bake/chill modules are configurable platform capabilities, not universal process setpoints. 2026-10-18 review: Enclosed single-chamber advanced resist processor, manual wafer load/unload with automated configurable spin coat, OmniSpray coating or development, up to 300 mm. A multifunction configured processor, not a simple benchtop spincoater. Avoid M24 bench-spinner price anchors. Official photographed cabinet visibly says EVG101 OmniSpray; image scope is spray-coating configuration of the model platform. Numeric purchase price and exact operating manual were not established. Manufacturer capabilities and catalogue options are not validated recipe conditions.</icon:notes>
    <icon:catalogScope>manufacturer_catalog</icon:catalogScope>
    <icon:manualMatchStatus>manufacturer_specification</icon:manualMatchStatus>
    <icon:modelEvidenceStatus>documented</icon:modelEvidenceStatus>
    <icon:imageScope>Manufacturer product image: Manufacturer product image for named model/configuration; see any size-configuration notes. Enclosed single-chamber advanced resist processor, manual wafer load/unload with automated configurable spin coat, OmniSpray coating or development, up to 300 mm. A multifunction configured processor, not a simple benchtop spincoater. Avoid M24 bench-spinner price anchors. Official photographed cabinet visibly says EVG101 OmniSpray; image scope is spray-coating configuration of the model platform.</icon:imageScope>
    <icon:mediaCheckedDate>2026-10-18</icon:mediaCheckedDate>
