    <icon:inputDescription>Materials/workload: Liquid formulation streams and the specified mixing cartridge/chip. Documented utilities/settings: flow setting/range, electrical supply. Family document; numeric limits/options must be checked for this variant.
Source: Manuals/0NIN1134 (1).pdf, PDF p. 1, 23, 47.</icon:inputDescription>
    <icon:outputDescription>Mixed formulation stream; nanoparticle properties remain formulation-dependent. Family document; numeric limits/options must be checked for this variant.
Source: Manuals/0NIN1134 (1).pdf, PDF p. 1.</icon:outputDescription>
    <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>°C (temperature); mL/min (flow); mL (volume); MPa (pressure); W (power); V (electrical voltage); A (electrical current); Hz (supply frequency); mm (travel/size)
Source: Manuals/0NIN1134 (1).pdf, PDF pp. 11, 23, 37, 46, 47, 89.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
