    <icon:notes>No make/model match to the user-designated Purdue list. Required tooling/modules, wafer size, resist/developer, geometry and substrate compatibility must be reviewed. Thermal bake/chill modules are configurable platform capabilities, not universal process setpoints. 2026-10-18 review: Automated multifunction resist coat/develop processing with wet-process and bake/chill modules; distinct200mm and300mm configurations. Separate configuration records in one documented EVG150 variant family are supported by explicit page sections and separate flyers. Preserve limits/module counts per configuration. Numeric purchase price and exact operating manual were not established. Manufacturer capabilities and catalogue options are not validated recipe conditions.</icon:notes>
