  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/REQ-EQ-008">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/ontology#InputOutputProfile"/>
    <dct:identifier>REQ-EQ-008</dct:identifier>
    <rdfs:label>Matsuura LUMEX Avance-25 - Reactive — input/output metadata</rdfs:label>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/equipment_io.csv"/>
    <icon:inputDescription>Metal powder feed, substrate/build plate and CAD/build instructions; hybrid processing also requires milling tools and a machining program. The inventory describes laser powder-bed fusion combined with subtractive machining. The reactive configuration and its gas, interlock and control limits are not specified by the linked standard-product page.
Source: Instrument Inventory Table (final).docx and I, Fabrication inventory entry and manufacturer product page.</icon:inputDescription>
    <icon:outputDescription>Hybrid additively built and milled metal component. The inventory identifies specimen/part fabrication; detailed process telemetry and ready/alarm outputs require the installed controller manual.
Source: Instrument Inventory Table (final).docx and I, Fabrication inventory entry and manufacturer product page.</icon:outputDescription>
    <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>W (laser-power specification on the linked standard LUMEX Avance-25 page). The page lists a standard 500 W laser; applicability to the existing/reactive inventory configurations is unconfirmed. Other operating/measurement units were not recovered from this page.
Source: Instrument Inventory Table (final).docx and I, Fabrication inventory entry and manufacturer product page.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
    <icon:sourceSha256>c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab</icon:sourceSha256>
    <icon:sourceSheet>Sheet1</icon:sourceSheet>
    <icon:sourceRow>16</icon:sourceRow>
    <icon:sourceModel>Matsuura LUMEX Avance-25 - Reactive</icon:sourceModel>
    <icon:importedDate>2026-10-30</icon:importedDate>
    <dct:references rdf:resource="https://www.lumex-matsuura.com/english/lumex-avance-25"/>
  </rdf:Description>
