    <icon:inputDescription>Materials/workload: Sample to be freeze-dried; refrigeration/vacuum and collector connections as specified.
Documented parameters/utilities: Time/duration (h), Electrical supply (Hz; V).
Interfaces named: LAN. Pin directions and permitted commands require the interface section.
Source-described sample/feed form: liquid sample.
Other per-input states/guards: not established by this functional summary.
Sources: H PDF pp. 1, 51, 73.</icon:inputDescription>
    <icon:outputDescription>Freeze-dried material and trapped sublimed solvent; residual solvent requires measurement.
Other output-state/pin mappings: not established by this functional summary.
Sources: H PDF pp. 1, 51, 73.</icon:outputDescription>
    <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>%; A; Hz; V; bar; h; kg; mbar; °C
Sources: H PDF pp. 10, 16, 17, 19, 20, 29, 36, 37 et seq..</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
