    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://schema.org/PropertyValue"/>
    <schema:name>Input and input states</schema:name>
    <schema:propertyID>inputs_and_states</schema:propertyID>
    <schema:value>Lipid formulation and membrane: Lipid suspension/emulsion and track-etched membrane; states: Membrane size and formulation are user-selected; material compatibility requires review; phase: Liquid suspension/emulsion
Pressurized drive gas: Compressed air/inert-gas drive described; model pressure rating must be respected; states: Gas connected/isolated; regulator controls applied pressure; phase: Gas
Pressure capacity: 500 psi maximum in current model-column specification; states: Pressure is continuous, not an enumerated command state; source conflict requires resolution
Jacket temperature control: Jacketed vessel for external heating/cooling; current family page lists 80 °C maximum; states: External temperature-control configuration; inlet conditions not fully specified; phase: Heat-transfer fluid not specified
Manual gas operating range: Nitrogen inlet 80–500 psi; source cylinder 5–10 MPa upstream of regulator; states: Regulated inert-gas supply; upstream cylinder pressure is not vessel working pressure; phase: Gas</schema:value>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/M43-04"/>
  </rdf:Description>
