    <icon:associationBasis>Commercial model candidate from the supplier catalogue. Curator functional classification and existing category/process associations, not literature-validated model use. Automatic potentiometric titration/dosing with 10/20 mL replaceable burettes. pH-stat suitability is curator planning only and requires confirmation of feedback-control mode, reagent compatibility and dosing guards.</icon:associationBasis>
    <icon:reviewDate>2026-10-19</icon:reviewDate>
    <icon:notes>Commercial model candidate from the supplier catalogue. Curator functional classification and existing category/process associations, not literature-validated model use. Automatic potentiometric titration/dosing with 10/20 mL replaceable burettes. pH-stat suitability is curator planning only and requires confirmation of feedback-control mode, reagent compatibility and dosing guards. Catalog states 220 V/50 Hz; US supply and regional configuration need supplier confirmation. Manufacturer legitimacy star pending independent review.</icon:notes>
