Source: Manuals/Bransonic_CPX_d11e22b0-db35-4ca8-b94d-a09451acd1b5.pdf, PDF p. 1.</icon:inputDescription>
    <icon:outputDescription>Ultrasonically treated/cleaned load; liquid remains in the bath. Family document; numeric limits/options must be checked for this variant.
Source: Manuals/Bransonic_CPX_d11e22b0-db35-4ca8-b94d-a09451acd1b5.pdf, PDF p. 1.</icon:outputDescription>
    <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>min (time); V (electrical voltage); kHz (frequency)
Source: Manuals/Bransonic_CPX_d11e22b0-db35-4ca8-b94d-a09451acd1b5.pdf, PDF pp. 1, 2.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
    <icon:sourceSha256>c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab</icon:sourceSha256>
