    <icon:inputDescription>Compatible fully skirted plates, lids or tip racks and Flex protocol movement commands; open/close jaw commands and gantry positioning. Jaws use a 36 VDC motor. Calibration uses the provided pin; permitted labware depends on the library definition.
Source: I, Gripper, Gripper specifications and Gripper calibration (H quickstart supports labware compatibility).</icon:inputDescription>
    <icon:outputDescription>Gripped/released and relocated labware; jaw states open/closed and robot-computed calibration position. Full force-sensor, electrical-state and telemetry mappings are not supplied by these linked sections.
Source: I, Gripper, Gripper specifications and Gripper calibration (H quickstart supports labware compatibility).</icon:outputDescription>
    <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>V DC (jaw motor); position/force display units are not specified in these sections.
Source: I, Gripper, Gripper specifications and Gripper calibration (H quickstart supports labware compatibility).</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
