    <icon:reviewDate>2026-10-18</icon:reviewDate>
    <icon:notes>No make/model match to the user-designated Purdue list. Required tooling/modules, wafer size, resist/developer, geometry and substrate compatibility must be reviewed.  2026-10-18 review: Maskless optical exposure using MLE digital patterning and solid-state light source; wafers up to300mm; stated feature capability≤2µm. Needs distinct maskless optical lithography class; not mask aligner/NIL hardware. Photograph visibly labels LITHOSCALE. LITHOSCALE XT is an additional catalogued model but excluded from this bounded10-model enrichment. Numeric purchase price and exact operating manual were not established. Manufacturer capabilities and catalogue options are not validated recipe conditions.</icon:notes>
