  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/route/P33">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/ontology#Route"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/ontology#ManufacturingProcess"/>
    <dct:identifier>P33</dct:identifier>
    <rdfs:label>pH-stat controlled coprecipitation of magnetite nanoparticles</rdfs:label>
    <skos:notation>P33</skos:notation>
    <icon:associationBasis>Reviewed methods of 10.1038/srep45484. Conceptual sequence only; unnamed equipment stays class-level. Aqueous coprecipitation, not hydrothermal synthesis. The source prints Methrom Titrino 888; its precise controller identity is unresolved and is not silently replaced by 888 Titrando. Recovery branch is optional and source-specific. Curator-added M82–M88 planning alternatives are distinguished from the article-reported apparatus; exact-model compatibility is not established.</icon:associationBasis>
  </rdf:Description>
