    <schema:value>[Automatic extraction; review required]
Temperature range: 0°C to 100.0°C; discrete states not established
Additional documented controls/states: lid opening/locking control.
Source: Manuals/Applied Biosystems ProFlex 96-well__linked-manual__783510c2a7.pdf, PDF p. 30.</schema:value>
