    <icon:inputDescription>Materials/workload: Sample and the specified ultrasonic probe; generator energy. Family document; numeric limits/options must be checked for this variant.
Source: Manuals/UIP500hdT-Fact-Sheet-HielscherUltrasonics_eng-v.20210723.pdf, PDF p. 1.</icon:inputDescription>
    <icon:outputDescription>Ultrasonically processed sample; actual dispersion/reaction outcome depends on conditions. Family document; numeric limits/options must be checked for this variant.
Source: Manuals/UIP500hdT-Fact-Sheet-HielscherUltrasonics_eng-v.20210723.pdf, PDF p. 1.</icon:outputDescription>
