    <icon:inputDescription>Paste/viscous functional material fed to a three-roll mill; roll-gap, speed and roll-temperature controls are described across the listed lines. Exact control ranges, utilities and mode/state mapping for this model are not enumerated on the family overview.
Source: I, German Dreiwalzwerke family overview and named model sections.</icon:inputDescription>
    <icon:outputDescription>Wetted, homogenized/dispersed material following three-roll processing. The source describes process monitoring/control but does not enumerate this variant’s signal outputs or state machine.
Source: I, German Dreiwalzwerke family overview and named model sections.</icon:outputDescription>
    <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>µm (roll-gap/dispersion scale); mPa·s (feed viscosity). Other units are not established for this exact variant.
Source: I, German Dreiwalzwerke family overview and named model sections.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
