  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/REQ-EQ-009">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/ontology#InputOutputProfile"/>
    <dct:identifier>REQ-EQ-009</dct:identifier>
    <rdfs:label>FormAlloy L2 — input/output metadata</rdfs:label>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/equipment_io.csv"/>
    <icon:inputDescription>Metal powder feed, substrate and laser toolpath/G-code; the cited experiment uses Inconel 625 powder (45–106 µm). The reported L2 configuration has a 2 kW CW fibre laser with a 1.2 mm spot. Set/recorded process inputs include laser power, XYZ position, A/C angles, scan velocity, powder-disc speed, shield/carrier-gas flow and infill/contour flags (0/1). These are the study configuration, not guaranteed limits of the Purdue machine.
Source: H, Hespeler et al., Applied Sciences 12 (2022), 8974, PDF pp. 7–9 and Table 1.</icon:inputDescription>
    <icon:outputDescription>Deposited metal part. In the documented L2 sensing configuration, logged outputs include elapsed program time, layer number, infill/contour flags, feed velocity, XYZ/A/C position, laser power, melt-pool diameter, enclosure temperature, powder-disc speed and gas flows. Melt-pool sensing requires the study’s installed monitoring hardware; later CT porosity is an external test, not an L2 output.
Source: H, Hespeler et al., Applied Sciences 12 (2022), 8974, PDF pp. 7–9 and Table 1.</icon:outputDescription>
    <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>s (time); mm and µm (position/spot/powder size); mm/min (scan velocity); degrees (A/C axes); W or kW (laser power); J/mm² (derived specific laser energy density); °C (enclosure temperature); rpm (powder-disc speed); L/min (shield/carrier gas); Hz (logging rate); layer index and 0/1 flags (dimensionless)
Source: H, Hespeler et al., Applied Sciences 12 (2022), 8974, PDF pp. 7–9 and Table 1.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
    <icon:sourceSha256>c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab</icon:sourceSha256>
    <icon:sourceSheet>Sheet1</icon:sourceSheet>
    <icon:sourceRow>10</icon:sourceRow>
    <icon:sourceModel>FormAlloy L2</icon:sourceModel>
    <icon:importedDate>2026-10-30</icon:importedDate>
    <dct:references rdf:resource="https://www.osti.gov/pages/servlets/purl/1981108"/>
  </rdf:Description>
