    <icon:inputDescription>Materials/workload: Sample in the specified optical/sampling arrangement and measurement settings.
Documented parameters/utilities: Flow setting/range (L/min), Electrical supply (V).
Interfaces named: ETHERNET, Ethernet, LAN, USB. Pin directions and permitted commands require the interface section.
Source-described sample/feed form: solid sample, gas stream.
Other per-input states/guards: not established by this functional summary.
Sources: H PDF pp. 7, 16, 23.</icon:inputDescription>
    <icon:outputDescription>Infrared spectrum and, for documented imaging configurations, spatially resolved infrared data.
Source-listed channels/measurands: spectra, transmittance, absorbance, wavenumber.
Other output-state/pin mappings: not established by this functional summary.
Sources: H PDF pp. 7, 16, 23.</icon:outputDescription>
    <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>L; L/min; V; cm-1; cm−1; kPa; °C
Sources: H PDF pp. 14, 16, 20, 23, 31, 61, 83, 84 et seq..</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
    <icon:sourceSha256>c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab</icon:sourceSha256>
    <icon:sourceSheet>Sheet1</icon:sourceSheet>
    <icon:sourceRow>790</icon:sourceRow>
