    <icon:inputDescription>End effector and workpiece: Tool/workpiece load within the model payload and center-of-gravity envelope; states: Configured payload and center of gravity; workpiece state depends on attached tool; phase: Not prescribed by robot manual
Control-box digital/safety/configurable inputs: PNP; input voltage −3–30 V; states: OFF region −3–5 V; ON region 11–30 V; 5–11 V is not a valid guaranteed logic region
Control-box analog inputs: Voltage mode 0–10 V or current mode 4–20 mA; 12-bit resolution; states: Voltage/current mode selected in GUI
Tool digital inputs: PNP with weak pull-down; floating input reads LOW; states: LOW ≤2.0 V; HIGH ≥5.5 V within permitted input range −0.5–26 V
Robot motion/program configuration: Joint/TCP moves, payload and tool/installation settings in PolyScope; states: Program/installation dependent; this extract does not enumerate all PolyScope commands or safety functions
Additional documented controls/states: manual/automatic operating mode, remote/local control.
Source: Manuals/Universal Robots UR16e__linked-manual__5e275e7429.pdf, PDF p. 21, 25.</icon:inputDescription>
    <icon:outputDescription>Control-box analog outputs: Voltage mode 0–10 V or current mode 4–20 mA; 12-bit resolution; states: Voltage/current output mode selected; range and load constraints apply
Control-box digital outputs: PNP; current 0–1 A with specified loads; states: HIGH/LOW; voltage drop and leakage limits given in manual
Tool digital outputs: Sinking NPN, sourcing PNP or push/pull; states: NPN active=LOW/inactive=open; PNP active=HIGH/inactive=open; push/pull active=HIGH/inactive=LOW; emergency stop=high impedance
Tool power supply: Selectable 0/12/24 V; specified single-/dual-pin current limits; states: Off, 12 V or 24 V; dual-pin mode changes output-pin availability
Tool/workpiece motion: Six-joint robot motion within configured workspace; states: Trajectory and stop conditions are program/safety-configuration dependent; phase: Workpiece phase is not prescribed</icon:outputDescription>
    <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>A; V; bit; joint count; kg; m/s; mA; mm; °; °/s; Ω</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
    <icon:sourceSha256>c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab</icon:sourceSha256>
