    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/equipment_io.csv"/>
    <icon:inputDescription>Moisture/light-sensitive items placed on perforated shelves; side-swing door and tab latches (open/closed/latched). This is the clear 3.0 variant; amber-only light-blocking claims are excluded.
Source: I, product features and F42073-1000 variant table.</icon:inputDescription>
