    <schema:value>Materials/workload: Items/sample introduced through the specified transfer interface; atmosphere-gas supply.
Documented parameters/utilities: Electrical supply (A), Gas/air supply (psi), Pressure setting/range (mbar).
Source-described sample/feed form: gas stream.
Other per-input states/guards: not established by this functional summary.
Sources: H PDF pp. 1, 12, 17, 21.
Additional documented controls/states: start/stop controls, manual/automatic operating mode.
Source: Manuals/Inert PureLab HE__linked-manual__a8ccb7b16e.pdf, PDF p. 27, 31.</schema:value>
