    <icon:inputDescription>Substrate, deposition precursors/process gases, RF plasma power, multi-zone temperature program, four-channel gas delivery and vacuum pumping. The linked product is a PE-CVD system, not evidence of an atomic-layer pulsing interface. Tube size and zone count depend on the variant.
Source: I, Overview and model-specific PECVD specifications.</icon:inputDescription>
    <icon:outputDescription>PECVD-deposited material/coated substrate; the page names nanowires and graphene as applications. Complete film-property predictions, data outputs and discrete controller-state mappings are not supplied.
Source: I, Overview and model-specific PECVD specifications.</icon:outputDescription>
    <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>°C (temperature); W (RF power); mm/inch (tube and zone geometry). Other flow/pressure units require the configured subsystem specification.
Source: I, Overview and model-specific PECVD specifications.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
