    <icon:notes>Mobile base without manipulator; arm/tool integration is separate. Exact TRACER 2.0 manual; do not substitute earlier TRACER manual merely marked version 2. Manufacturer review 2026-10-15: TRACER 2.0 is manufactured by AgileX Robotics, supported by manufacturer model page and the existing manufacturer-authored manual. Product URL updated to the current TRACER 2.0 page; previous URL contained unrelated Ranger Air copy. Brand research-use evidence is Mobile ALOHA (section 3, page 4), which uses the earlier Tracer AGV; it does not verify the TRACER 2.0 configuration or nanomaterial capability.</icon:notes>
