    <icon:verificationNotes>Official catalog documents history since 1946: https://llfurnace.com/assets/pdfs/llfurnace-catalog-l.pdf . Caltech-hosted SPIE NuSTAR mirror-substrate paper independently identifies L&amp;L ovens at NASA Goddard. Brand-level research use and longstanding manufacturer identity support a green star; this does not certify a quench model for the cited nanomaterial process.</icon:verificationNotes>
