    <icon:notes>No make/model match to the user-designated Purdue list. Required tooling/modules, wafer size, resist/developer, geometry and substrate compatibility must be reviewed. Thermal bake/chill modules are configurable platform capabilities, not universal process setpoints. 2026-10-18 review: Fully automated modular resist processing up to 200 mm; spin/spray/develop plus bake/chill and robot handling. Current page describes a next generation of same named EVG120; do not make separate successor record without explicit stable identity need. Current exact Flyer filename includes26_01. Numeric purchase price and exact operating manual were not established. Manufacturer capabilities and catalogue options are not validated recipe conditions.</icon:notes>
