Source: Manuals/Biostat-B-Brochure-en-B-SBI1513-Sartorius.pdf, PDF p. 1, 16, 18.</icon:inputDescription>
    <icon:outputDescription>Cultured broth/biomass and process monitoring data; yield depends on the culture process. Documented readouts/functions: pH, dissolved oxygen and temperature feedback (installed sensors). Family document; numeric limits/options must be checked for this variant.
Source: Manuals/Biostat-B-Brochure-en-B-SBI1513-Sartorius.pdf, PDF p. 1, 4.</icon:outputDescription>
    <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>L (volume); h (time); mm (travel/size); °C (temperature); bar (pressure); psi (pressure); W (power); rpm (speed); V (electrical voltage); mA (electrical current); L/min (flow); mL/min (flow)
Source: Manuals/Biostat-B-Brochure-en-B-SBI1513-Sartorius.pdf, PDF pp. 2, 15, 16, 17, 18, 19.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
