  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/REQ-EQ-014">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/ontology#InputOutputProfile"/>
    <dct:identifier>REQ-EQ-014</dct:identifier>
    <rdfs:label>EDMMax 434W Fast Wire EDM — input/output metadata</rdfs:label>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/equipment_io.csv"/>
    <icon:inputDescription>Conductive workpiece; 0.18 mm (0.007 in) reusable molybdenum wire; deionized water with the specified additive for the 434W (do not transfer the pure-water 434WW specification). On-board CAD/CNC instructions, USB/LAN DXF and MDI inputs. Flyer lists 220 V, three-phase, 60 Hz, 3–5 kVA input for the four-axis family, with no chiller or air-pressure requirement. 434W travel: X 400, Y 320, Z 410 mm; maximum workpiece mass 600 kg.
Source: Manuals/EDMMax Fast Wire Flyer (new).pdf; I, PDF pp. 1–2, visually reviewed, and the exact 434W seller listing.</icon:inputDescription>
    <icon:outputDescription>Four-axis discharge-cut workpiece, including LPBF parts separated from build plates; wire recirculates, and swarf is carried into the dielectric filtration system. Cut taper is approximately ±3°. The flyer does not define machine-ready, alarm or numerical-control pin states.
Source: Manuals/EDMMax Fast Wire Flyer (new).pdf; I, PDF pp. 1–2, visually reviewed, and the exact 434W seller listing.</icon:outputDescription>
    <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>mm and in (wire diameter and axis travel); kg and lb (workpiece mass); degrees (taper); m/s (wire speed, family description); V, Hz and kVA (supply). No cutting-current or voltage measurement range is supplied.
Source: Manuals/EDMMax Fast Wire Flyer (new).pdf; I, PDF pp. 1–2, visually reviewed, and the exact 434W seller listing.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
    <icon:sourceSha256>c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab</icon:sourceSha256>
    <icon:sourceSheet>Sheet1</icon:sourceSheet>
    <icon:sourceRow>7</icon:sourceRow>
    <icon:sourceModel>EDMMax 434W Fast Wire EDM</icon:sourceModel>
    <icon:importedDate>2026-10-30</icon:importedDate>
    <dct:references rdf:resource="https://f.machineryhost.com/4a716f7ba05468f225127f29aa2040c5/4eef57ce50429e399c42d2ba63b8dbaa/EDMMax%20Fast%20Wire%20Flyer%20%28new%29.pdf"/>
    <dct:references rdf:resource="https://www.edmnetwork.com/listings/4738614-edmmax-434w-fast-wire-edm"/>
  </rdf:Description>
