    <icon:imageScope>Manufacturer CAD/render: RF atom source with cylindrical body, raised circular shutter and electronics enclosure. TAS30 per official filename and TAS30/TAS60 product context. Atom-source component. Rights reserved; linked official asset.</icon:imageScope>
