    <icon:productPageScope>UHV RF atom-source components for atomic species deposition/cleaning; not turnkey vacuum systems. Manufacturer product claims only. P/N links express curator relevance, not source-article apparatus, measured performance, exact host compatibility or mandatory process steps.</icon:productPageScope>
