  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-property/REQ-EQ-043%3Ainputs_and_states">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://schema.org/PropertyValue"/>
    <schema:name>Input and input states</schema:name>
    <schema:propertyID>inputs_and_states</schema:propertyID>
    <schema:value>Workload: payload mounted on the mobile base (rated 100 kg). Power: 24 V battery. Commands: forward/reverse linear velocity and left/right angular velocity through CAN 2.0B at 500 kbit/s or the RC handset; emergency stop must be released. Feedback modes are standby=0x00, CAN=0x01 and RC=0x02. RC takes priority over CAN. Motion-command timeout after 500 ms sets velocity to zero.
Source: H, PDF pp. 3, 7–8, 11–19, 22–26, 34.</schema:value>
