    <icon:verificationNotes>Official supplier website confirmed through browser search indexed primary page; direct automated fetch may be restricted. Direct fetch unavailable: HTTP Error 403: Forbidden Tennessee Tech materials science laboratory lists Hitachi FE-SEM. Independent documented use supports research relevance, not prevalence or exact-model validation.</icon:verificationNotes>
