    <icon:inputDescription>Materials/workload: Compatible sample and installed dispersing/homogenizing tool. Documented utilities/settings: electrical supply.
Source: Manuals/Silverson-L4RT-mixer.pdf, PDF p. 6, 44.</icon:inputDescription>
