    <icon:inputDescription>Materials/workload: Sample in the specified pan/crucible; temperature program and purge conditions. Documented utilities/settings: electrical supply, flow setting/range, gas/air supply. Family document; numeric limits/options must be checked for this variant.
Source: Manuals/TGA55XX-site-prep.pdf, PDF p. 1, 7, 8, 11.</icon:inputDescription>
    <icon:outputDescription>Sample mass versus temperature/time; interpretation depends on analysis and conditions. Documented readouts/functions: sample mass/change versus temperature/time. Family document; numeric limits/options must be checked for this variant.
Source: Manuals/TGA55XX-site-prep.pdf, PDF p. 1, 2.</icon:outputDescription>
    <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>kg (mass/load); W (power); mL/min (flow); mL (volume); °C (temperature); kPa (pressure)
Source: Manuals/TGA55XX-site-prep.pdf, PDF pp. 6, 7, 8, 11.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
