Source: H, PDF pp. 6–10, 12 (EUROSTAR 20 digital column).</icon:outputDescription>
    <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>rpm (speed); N·cm (shaft torque); L (water stirring quantity); mPa·s (viscosity); V AC, Hz and W (electrical ratings)
