    <icon:inputDescription>SmartSoft-AES analysis queues: survey, multiplex scan, depth-profile and map tasks; loops, pauses and service startup/shutdown/outgassing tasks. Queues can be validated, saved, loaded and edited during execution. This upgrade flyer does not enumerate material, utility or electrical-signal inputs.
Source: I, PDF pp. 1–2, SmartSoft-AES 6.2.1 features and supported systems.</icon:inputDescription>
    <icon:outputDescription>Configured AES acquisition results, saved queues and displayed system/queue status. The optional System Evaluation Environment records system parameters. The flyer does not specify complete signal-state maps, result units or export formats.
Source: I, PDF pp. 1–2, SmartSoft-AES 6.2.1 features and supported systems.</icon:outputDescription>
