    <icon:scope>Commercial model candidate from the supplier catalogue. Curator functional classification and existing category/process associations, not literature-validated model use. Automatic potentiometric titration/dosing with 10/20 mL replaceable burettes. pH-stat suitability is curator planning only and requires confirmation of feedback-control mode, reagent compatibility and dosing guards.</icon:scope>
