    <icon:inputDescription>Materials/workload: Sample in the specified pan/crucible; temperature program and purge conditions. Family document; numeric limits/options must be checked for this variant.
Source: Manuals/008493_01.pdf, PDF p. 1.</icon:inputDescription>
    <icon:outputDescription>Sample mass versus temperature/time; interpretation depends on analysis and conditions. Documented readouts/functions: sample mass/change versus temperature/time, thermal analysis curve. Family document; numeric limits/options must be checked for this variant.
Source: Manuals/008493_01.pdf, PDF p. 1.</icon:outputDescription>
    <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>mg (mass); µL (volume)
Source: Manuals/008493_01.pdf, PDF pp. 1.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
    <icon:sourceSha256>c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab</icon:sourceSha256>
