    <schema:value>Lipid formulation and membrane: Lipid suspension/emulsion and track-etched membrane; states: Membrane size and formulation are user-selected; material compatibility requires review; phase: Liquid suspension/emulsion
Pressurized drive gas: Compressed air/inert-gas drive described; model pressure rating must be respected; states: Gas connected/isolated; regulator controls applied pressure; phase: Gas
Pressure capacity: 800 psi maximum in current model-column specification; states: Pressure is continuous, not an enumerated command state; source conflict requires resolution
Jacket temperature control: Jacketed vessel for external heating/cooling; current family page lists 80 °C maximum; states: External temperature-control configuration; inlet conditions not fully specified; phase: Heat-transfer fluid not specified</schema:value>
