    <icon:scope>UCLA equipment page dated 2022-01-19, reviewed 2026-10-18. Historical institutional listing; current availability and exact asset configuration are unverified. One market model family, two institution configurations. Do not create N-MBE and As/Sb-MBE as unrelated Veeco model names. {"material_system": "(In, Ga, Al)/(As, Sb)", "group_III_sources": [{"element": "In", "type": "SUMO cell"}, {"element": "Ga", "type": "SUMO cell"}, {"element": "Al", "type": "SUMO cell"}], "group_V_sources": [{"element": "As", "type": "valved cracker"}, {"element": "Sb", "type": "valved cracker"}], "dopant_sources": ["Si", "Te", "Be"], "wafer_holder_diameter_max": {"value": 3, "unit": "inch"}, "optical_pyrometer_range": {"lower": 440, "upper": 800, "unit": "Â°C", "scope": "measurement range, not process setpoint"}, "monitoring": ["200 amu RGA", "RHEED", "KSA400"], "control": "MOLLY"} Hardware capacities are not growth recipe setpoints.</icon:scope>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/evidence_registry.csv"/>
