    <rdfs:label>Sartorius arium pro VF — input/output metadata</rdfs:label>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/equipment_io.csv"/>
    <icon:inputDescription>Materials/workload: Specified feedwater and purification consumables; utility connections. Documented utilities/settings: flow setting/range, electrical supply. Documented controls/states: start/stop controls. Family document; numeric limits/options must be checked for this variant.
Source: Manuals/Ultrapure-Lab-Water-System-Arium-Pro-Datasheet-en-Sartorius.pdf, PDF p. 1, 4, 11, 13.</icon:inputDescription>
    <icon:outputDescription>Purified water; quality readings only as documented. Family document; numeric limits/options must be checked for this variant.
Source: Manuals/Ultrapure-Lab-Water-System-Arium-Pro-Datasheet-en-Sartorius.pdf, PDF p. 1.</icon:outputDescription>
    <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>µS/cm (conductivity); °C (temperature); bar (pressure); L (volume); L/min (flow); mL (volume); A (electrical current); mm (travel/size); V (electrical voltage)
Source: Manuals/Ultrapure-Lab-Water-System-Arium-Pro-Datasheet-en-Sartorius.pdf, PDF pp. 1, 2, 4, 8, 11, 14, 15.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
    <icon:sourceSha256>c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab</icon:sourceSha256>
