  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-property/REQ-EQ-035%3Ainputs_and_states">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://schema.org/PropertyValue"/>
    <schema:name>Input and input states</schema:name>
    <schema:propertyID>inputs_and_states</schema:propertyID>
    <schema:value>Workload: end effector/workpiece within the 30 kg payload rating; six-axis motion program. Supported operating modes: collaborative or high-speed non-collaborative. Control box: 16 digital inputs and 4 analogue inputs, stated as 24 V tolerant; TCP/IP, Modbus TCP and EtherNet/IP are listed. Tool M8 8-pin connector: 2 digital inputs and 2 analogue inputs (24 V tolerant); RS-485/UART up to 10 Mbit/s. Controller supply: 90–264 VAC, 47–63 Hz; program/payload-dependent power up to 4 kW. Tool-I/O hardware is listed, but the April 2026 footnote says software support was forthcoming; confirm installed firmware. Input HIGH/LOW thresholds and analogue ranges/scaling are not specified.
Source: Manuals2/6ad0b7d901069695bb0263e1_New Thor Specs 202604.pdf, PDF p. 2.</schema:value>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/REQ-EQ-035"/>
  </rdf:Description>
