    <dct:description>XPert Nano 2 ft enclosure, 100/115 V AC, blower and stainless steel work surface included; supporting stand required separately. Public US web price; special shipping extra. Standard supplier/distributor catalog offer for manufacturer equipment, with no used/refurbished marking; interpreted as new-catalog condition, not a guarantee of stock.</dct:description>
