    <icon:verificationNotes>Stockholm University chemistry mechanochemistry infrastructure lists Resodyn LABRAM II. Official manufacturer/brand product web presence checked through retrieved page or published official documentation. This is brand-level evidence; it does not verify every listed model, current availability, or common adoption.</icon:verificationNotes>
