    <icon:reviewDate>2026-10-18</icon:reviewDate>
    <icon:notes>Product text explicitly identifies a 30-position stage, heating up to 500 degrees C and DC bias up to 4000 V. These are supplier hardware capabilities, not process settings or an extracted position/fiber/direction interface. Photo is generic SMPL-family hardware; exact MH4i identity is not established. Do not conflate this 30-position stage with the separate 25-sample option on the UHV systems page. Mismatched atom-source brochure excluded. Public purchase price and exact-model operating manual were not published in this bounded review. No documented successor relationship or newest-generation claim. No make/model match in the user-designated Purdue list; generic PVD wording is not asset identity.</icon:notes>
