  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/M07-07">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/ontology#InputOutputProfile"/>
    <dct:identifier>M07-07</dct:identifier>
    <rdfs:label>KD Scientific Legato 200 — input/output metadata</rdfs:label>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/equipment_io.csv"/>
    <icon:inputDescription>Liquid in one or two syringes, selected syringe type/diameter, infusion rate and target volume or time. Legato 200 is INFUSE ONLY; do not assign Legato 210 withdrawal or 210P/270P programming features. Supply: 100–240 VAC, 50–60 Hz. USB/RS-232 and a 15-pin I/O/TTL connector are documented for the family; the external footswitch can toggle run/stop or follow rising/falling edges. The 0–10 V speed-control input is a factory option.
Source: Manuals/KDS Legato 200 Series_5617-002REV2.0.pdf, PDF pp. 6, 8, 11, 17–19, 62–65, 79, 89.</icon:inputDescription>
    <icon:outputDescription>Infused liquid; pump/run indication, programmed trigger outputs where supported, completion and stall/power-failure messages. Family TTL outputs are Boolean high/low; only functions enabled by the installed Legato 200 configuration apply. No withdrawal stream is produced by this infuse-only model.
Source: Manuals/KDS Legato 200 Series_5617-002REV2.0.pdf, PDF pp. 6, 8, 11, 17–19, 62–65, 79, 89.</icon:outputDescription>
    <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>pL/min, µL/min, mL/min and mL/h (flow selections/range); µL and mL (syringe/target volume); mm (syringe diameter); s/min/h (time); V, Hz and W (supply/optional control); TTL high/low (dimensionless). Flow limits depend on syringe size.
Source: Manuals/KDS Legato 200 Series_5617-002REV2.0.pdf, PDF pp. 6, 8, 11, 17–19, 62–65, 79, 89.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
    <icon:sourceSha256>c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab</icon:sourceSha256>
    <icon:sourceSheet>Sheet1</icon:sourceSheet>
    <icon:sourceRow>542</icon:sourceRow>
    <icon:sourceModel>KD Scientific Legato 200</icon:sourceModel>
    <icon:importedDate>2026-10-30</icon:importedDate>
  </rdf:Description>
