  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/evidence/CAT-EV-24FB304A3AD2F9B2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/ontology#SourceEvidence"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"/>
    <dct:identifier>CAT-EV-24FB304A3AD2F9B2</dct:identifier>
    <rdfs:label>Theris identifies Theris NC400 in its official product documentation.</rdfs:label>
    <icon:claim>Theris identifies Theris NC400 in its official product documentation.</icon:claim>
    <icon:classification>curator_reviewed_catalog</icon:classification>
    <icon:scope>Full custom nanoparticle/PVD deposition systems. Manufacturer product claims only. P/N links express curator relevance, not source-article apparatus, measured performance, exact host compatibility or mandatory process steps. Named under THERIS NANOTECHNOLOGY Full Deposition Systems in NanoStream brochure page 4. The webpage describes chamber size options without explicitly mapping each diameter to a model name. Custom host/source configuration must be reviewed. No exact-model NC400 standalone image established; image intentionally absent. Public purchase price and exact-model operating manual were not published in this bounded review. No documented successor relationship or newest-generation claim. No make/model match in the user-designated Purdue list; generic PVD wording is not asset identity.</icon:scope>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/evidence_registry.csv"/>
