    <icon:classification>curator_reviewed_price</icon:classification>
    <icon:scope>Official North America special-price set, 115 V single phase 16 A 50-60 Hz. Includes UIP1000hdT, FC100L1-1S flow cell, BS4d22 and BS4d40 sonotrodes, RFLA100 flange, B4-1.8 booster, ST2 stand. Net price FOB Mt. Holly NJ; 100% prepayment. Not bare processor or MSRP/list-price benchmark. Official manufacturer North America new-equipment set offer with 12-month warranty; no used/reconditioned indication.</icon:scope>
