    <icon:scope>One 4746 high-pressure acid-digestion vessel, seller SKU CX1-9OM-4746 / 25227-061. Seller calls it 25 mL; manufacturer's nominal sample vessel is 23 mL, so preserve that seller wording as an offer note rather than changing canonical capacity. Not a heater. Standard commercial catalog listing; new condition inferred, stock/lead time unconfirmed unless expressly stated by seller.</icon:scope>
