    <icon:classification>curator_reviewed_price</icon:classification>
    <icon:scope>Sorvall WX 90+ ultracentrifuge, exact supplier SKU. 208-240 V 50/60 Hz configuration is corroborated in Clarkson product table. Rotor, tubes and service extras not assumed included. Public distributor catalog price, not manufacturer MSRP. Standard supplier/distributor catalog offer for manufacturer equipment, with no used/refurbished marking; interpreted as new-catalog condition, not a guarantee of stock.</icon:scope>
