    <icon:scope>Commercial model candidate from the supplier catalogue. Curator functional classification and existing category/process associations, not literature-validated model use. Planetary ball mill LMPBM-A100 with 50–250 mL jars. High-energy milling capability is functional class association; exact jar/media/material compatibility and nanoscale output require verification.</icon:scope>
