    <rdfs:label>Plasma-assisted molecular-beam epitaxy of III-nitride layers</rdfs:label>
    <skos:notation>P46</skos:notation>
    <icon:associationBasis>Institution capability-derived planning route, not an extracted experimental recipe. Preparation, growth and recovery order is curator abstraction; optional characterization branches are inferred from companion facility capabilities. Nanostructure composition/dimensions, conditions, yield and properties require separate methods evidence. Hardware maxima are not setpoints. Theris 2026-10-18 catalogue links are curator capability/auxiliary associations; source step requirements and source-reported apparatus remain unchanged. Exact configuration and process suitability require review.</icon:associationBasis>
  </rdf:Description>
