    <icon:inputDescription>Lipid formulation and membrane: Lipid suspension/emulsion and track-etched membrane; states: Membrane size and formulation are user-selected; material compatibility requires review; phase: Liquid suspension/emulsion
Pressurized drive gas: Compressed air/inert-gas drive described; model pressure rating must be respected; states: Gas connected/isolated; regulator controls applied pressure; phase: Gas
Pressure capacity: 500 psi maximum in current model-column specification; states: Pressure is continuous, not an enumerated command state; source conflict requires resolution
Jacket temperature control: Jacketed vessel for external heating/cooling; current family page lists 80 °C maximum; states: External temperature-control configuration; inlet conditions not fully specified; phase: Heat-transfer fluid not specified
Manual gas operating range: Nitrogen inlet 80–500 psi; source cylinder 5–10 MPa upstream of regulator; states: Regulated inert-gas supply; upstream cylinder pressure is not vessel working pressure; phase: Gas</icon:inputDescription>
    <icon:outputDescription>Extruded formulation: Liposome/lipopolyplex suspension after passage through selected membrane; states: Processed suspension; actual particle-size distribution/yield requires measurement; phase: Liquid suspension</icon:outputDescription>
    <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>MPa; mL; nm; psi; °C; ℃</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
