Pressure capacity: 800 psi maximum in current model-column specification; states: Pressure is continuous, not an enumerated command state; source conflict requires resolution
Jacket temperature control: Jacketed vessel for external heating/cooling; current family page lists 80 °C maximum; states: External temperature-control configuration; inlet conditions not fully specified; phase: Heat-transfer fluid not specified</icon:inputDescription>
    <icon:outputDescription>Extruded formulation: Liposome/lipopolyplex suspension after passage through selected membrane; states: Processed suspension; actual particle-size distribution/yield requires measurement; phase: Liquid suspension</icon:outputDescription>
