  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-property/REQ-EQ-009%3Ainputs_and_states">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://schema.org/PropertyValue"/>
    <schema:name>Input and input states</schema:name>
    <schema:propertyID>inputs_and_states</schema:propertyID>
    <schema:value>Metal powder feed, substrate and laser toolpath/G-code; the cited experiment uses Inconel 625 powder (45–106 µm). The reported L2 configuration has a 2 kW CW fibre laser with a 1.2 mm spot. Set/recorded process inputs include laser power, XYZ position, A/C angles, scan velocity, powder-disc speed, shield/carrier-gas flow and infill/contour flags (0/1). These are the study configuration, not guaranteed limits of the Purdue machine.
Source: H, Hespeler et al., Applied Sciences 12 (2022), 8974, PDF pp. 7–9 and Table 1.</schema:value>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/REQ-EQ-009"/>
  </rdf:Description>
