    <schema:propertyID>inputs_and_states</schema:propertyID>
    <schema:value>Metal powder feed, substrate/build plate and CAD/build instructions; hybrid processing also requires milling tools and a machining program. The inventory describes laser powder-bed fusion combined with subtractive machining. The reactive configuration and its gas, interlock and control limits are not specified by the linked standard-product page.
Source: Instrument Inventory Table (final).docx and I, Fabrication inventory entry and manufacturer product page.</schema:value>
