  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-property/REQ-EQ-014%3Aoutputs_and_states">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://schema.org/PropertyValue"/>
    <schema:name>Output and output states</schema:name>
    <schema:propertyID>outputs_and_states</schema:propertyID>
    <schema:value>Four-axis discharge-cut workpiece, including LPBF parts separated from build plates; wire recirculates, and swarf is carried into the dielectric filtration system. Cut taper is approximately ±3°. The flyer does not define machine-ready, alarm or numerical-control pin states.
Source: Manuals/EDMMax Fast Wire Flyer (new).pdf; I, PDF pp. 1–2, visually reviewed, and the exact 434W seller listing.</schema:value>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/REQ-EQ-014"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/route/P29">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/ontology#Route"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/ontology#ManufacturingProcess"/>
    <dct:identifier>P29</dct:identifier>
    <rdfs:label>Solution casting of nanofiller/polymer composite films</rdfs:label>
    <skos:notation>P29</skos:notation>
    <icon:associationBasis>Reviewed methods of 10.1021/am302624t. Conceptual sequence only; unnamed equipment stays class-level. M11-04 identity matches stated IKA T25digital; do not propagate evidence to TubeDrive or other rotor-stator models. Unverified/inconsistent operating-speed values omitted. As-received CNC/CNF preparation summary is citation-mediated, unlike direct film fabrication.</icon:associationBasis>
  </rdf:Description>
