    <icon:classification>curator_reviewed_price</icon:classification>
    <icon:scope>Manufacturer online-exclusive offer for exact SKU FB1315M. Thermolyne small benchtop muffle furnace FB1315M,1.3L,120V,CSA approved, each. Official USD2090 list, with separate USD1881 online-exclusive discount at check date. Use2090 as list benchmark;1881 is an online offer, not MSRP. Optional accessories and other voltage variants excluded. Current discounted offer is separate from the official list benchmark. Account prices, stock, shipping and taxes may differ.</icon:scope>
