    <icon:classification>curator_reviewed_media</icon:classification>
    <icon:scope>EUROSTAR 20 digital new-generation photo, explicitly labeled EUROSTAR 20 digital by IKA supplier VERKON. Catalog lists 20 digital as order code 412 482 105 154 and new 25 L / 40 Ncm generation matching IKA 0020105154. No inference of an installed asset or other EUROSTAR generations. Remote image reference; source rights are retained. The photograph does not establish an installed asset, delivered configuration, price, operating procedure or experimental validation.</icon:scope>
