    <rdfs:label>Labmate lists Potentiometric Titrator LMPT-304 and a model-specific technical catalogue.</rdfs:label>
    <icon:claim>Labmate lists Potentiometric Titrator LMPT-304 and a model-specific technical catalogue.</icon:claim>
    <icon:classification>curator_reviewed_catalog</icon:classification>
    <icon:scope>Commercial model candidate from the supplier catalogue. Curator functional classification and existing category/process associations, not literature-validated model use. Automatic potentiometric titration/dosing with touchscreen and 100 saved methods. Proposed alternative to the M63 dosing class, not demonstrated use in the P33 paper.</icon:scope>
