    <icon:inputDescription>Polymer spinning formulations, syringe-pump feeds and roll-to-roll collector substrate. Two pumps and two high-voltage supplies can independently process two polymers. Touchscreen controls and stored/recalled parameter sets; spark protection, safety relays and a safety-door option are listed.
