    <icon:outputDescription>Continuous electrospun nanofibers/composite web on the collector; stored process parameter sets. The catalog does not enumerate controller signal pins, alarm states or data-export format.
Source: I, PDF pp. 3–7.</icon:outputDescription>
    <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>kV (high-voltage supplies); mm (fiber deposition width); m/min (substrate winding speed)
