    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/equipment_io.csv"/>
    <icon:inputDescription>Liquid and selected syringe/valve configuration; stroke/valve commands; 24 VDC supply. Syringe/valve options determine fluid path and aliquot volume. The specification lists 1 s–50 h per stroke; communication command-state details are not enumerated.
Source: I, PDF pp. 2–4 (Cavro Centris features and specifications).</icon:inputDescription>
    <icon:outputDescription>Precisely displaced/dispensed liquid aliquots through the selected valve path. No particle-production guarantee, complete electrical-output state map or logging format is specified.
Source: I, PDF pp. 2–4 (Cavro Centris features and specifications).</icon:outputDescription>
    <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>µL/mL (syringe volume); s/h per stroke (speed); V DC/A (supply); % (accuracy/precision); °C/°F and %RH (operating conditions)
Source: I, PDF pp. 2–4 (Cavro Centris features and specifications).</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
    <icon:sourceSha256>c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab</icon:sourceSha256>
