    <icon:inputDescription>Materials/workload: Prepared specimen in the chamber; electron-beam, vacuum and scan conditions. Documented utilities/settings: pressure setting/range, electrical stimulus. Family document; numeric limits/options must be checked for this variant.
Source: Manuals/pDocument-SU5000-Brochure-2016.pdf, PDF p. 1, 2.</icon:inputDescription>
    <icon:outputDescription>Electron-microscopy images; optional analytical-detector results require the documented detector configuration. Documented readouts/functions: secondary-electron images, elemental analysis (configured detector). Family document; numeric limits/options must be checked for this variant.
Source: Manuals/pDocument-SU5000-Brochure-2016.pdf, PDF p. 1, 2.</icon:outputDescription>
    <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>Pa (pressure); nA (electrical current); nm (wavelength/size); kV (electrical voltage); V (electrical voltage)
Source: Manuals/pDocument-SU5000-Brochure-2016.pdf, PDF pp. 1, 2.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
