    <icon:inputDescription>Materials/workload: Specified heat-transfer fluid, return flow and temperature request; power/cooling connections. Documented utilities/settings: temperature setting/range, time/duration, pressure setting/range.
Source: Manuals/Polyscience_AD07R-20_Operators_Manual.pdf, PDF p. 1, 4, 27, 57.</icon:inputDescription>
    <icon:outputDescription>Temperature-conditioned circulating fluid; temperature/status indication where documented.
Source: Manuals/Polyscience_AD07R-20_Operators_Manual.pdf, PDF p. 1.</icon:outputDescription>
    <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>°C (temperature); Hz (frequency); s (time); bar (pressure); min (time); h (time); psi (pressure); V (electrical voltage)
Source: Manuals/Polyscience_AD07R-20_Operators_Manual.pdf, PDF pp. 4, 16, 27, 30, 40, 54, 57, 71.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
    <icon:sourceSha256>c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab</icon:sourceSha256>
