    <rdfs:label>Manufacturer catalog presents this representative family image for Thermo Scientific Vacutherm VT 6025.</rdfs:label>
    <icon:claim>Manufacturer catalog presents this representative family image for Thermo Scientific Vacutherm VT 6025.</icon:claim>
    <icon:classification>curator_reviewed_media</icon:classification>
    <icon:scope>Manufacturer uses this shared Vacutherm series catalog photograph on the exact 25 L, 120 V SKU51014551 page. The picture is a representative series configuration with open glass door and control tower; chamber size, heating/controller options and installed asset identity are not established by the photo. Not evidence of the installed 25 L configuration. Remote reference; source rights retained. No ownership or performance assertion.</icon:scope>
