    <schema:propertyID>outputs_and_states</schema:propertyID>
    <schema:value>PARTIAL FAMILY REFERENCE — installed CB1-04 controller not verified. The listed safety function is emergency-stop activation on shutter failure. In the documented safety-shutter subsystem, a detected failure interrupts SHUTTER ERROR OUTPUTS; an external power-switching/emergency-stop circuit is needed to remove laser power, and shutter function is restored by a complete controller power cycle. Exact CB1-04 laser-output specifications, connector levels and status-pin mappings are not established; CB3-80W performance limits were not transferred.
Source: Manuals2/CARBIDE-CB3-80W-User-Manual (1).pdf, PDF pp. 84–89 and 107.</schema:value>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/REQ-EQ-040"/>
  </rdf:Description>
