  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/REQ-EQ-044">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/ontology#InputOutputProfile"/>
    <dct:identifier>REQ-EQ-044</dct:identifier>
    <rdfs:label>FANUC CRX-10iA Robot Arm — input/output metadata</rdfs:label>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/equipment_io.csv"/>
    <icon:inputDescription>Specimens/plates and a mounted end effector for a six-joint robotic manipulator; programmed pick-up, transport and placement. The inventory gives the intended work, but both linked FANUC documents were unavailable in this sweep, so supply, safety-input and motion-command states are not established.
Source: Instrument Inventory Table (final).docx, Automation / FANUC CRX-10iA entry.</icon:inputDescription>
    <icon:outputDescription>Repositioned specimens/plates between instruments or stages. Position, force, status and output-pin mappings require the actual controller/model documentation.
Source: Instrument Inventory Table (final).docx, Automation / FANUC CRX-10iA entry.</icon:outputDescription>
    <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>kg (wrist payload and robot mass); mm (reach/repeatability); degrees (joint motion ranges); mm/s (collaborative/high-speed mode Cartesian speed); N·m (allowable wrist moment); kg·m² (wrist inertia); VAC (input power-source voltage). The sheet specifies 10 kg wrist payload, 1249 mm reach and ±0.04 mm repeatability. These are datasheet units; the complete controller-unit and electrical pin/state map is not supplied.
Source: Manuals2/CRX-10iA_Technical_Specifications_Datasheet.pdf, PDF p. 1.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
    <icon:sourceSha256>c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab</icon:sourceSha256>
    <icon:sourceSheet>Sheet1</icon:sourceSheet>
    <icon:sourceRow>8</icon:sourceRow>
    <icon:sourceModel>FANUC CRX-10iA Robot Arm</icon:sourceModel>
    <icon:importedDate>2026-10-30</icon:importedDate>
    <dct:references rdf:resource="https://www.fanuc.eu/~/media/files/pdf/products/robots/educational%20cell/fanuc-crx-educational-cell-manual.pdf?la=de"/>
    <dct:references rdf:resource="https://www.fanucamerica.com/docs/default-source/crx-data-sheets/crx-10ia-data-sheet.pdf"/>
  </rdf:Description>
