Source: Manuals/Manual_MA8.pdf, PDF p. 1, 2, 4.</icon:inputDescription>
    <icon:outputDescription>Optically exposed resist/substrate; development is a separate process unless explicitly integrated. Family document; numeric limits/options must be checked for this variant.
Source: Manuals/Manual_MA8.pdf, PDF p. 1.</icon:outputDescription>
    <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>bar (pressure)
Source: Manuals/Manual_MA8.pdf, PDF pp. 2.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
