Temperature profile: Temperature/hold-time steps; repetition count; block_max_volume; states: Ordered profile steps; 25 µL default block_max_volume is an API parameter, not machine capacity
API control methods: open_lid, close_lid, set/start_set_lid_temperature, set/start_set_block_temperature, execute/start_execute_profile, deactivate/deactivate_block/deactivate_lid; states: Open/close requests; configure/run; controller active/deactivated; API-version dependent</schema:value>
