  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-property/MIT-M35-0093171348B8%3Ainputs_and_states">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://schema.org/PropertyValue"/>
    <schema:name>Input and input states</schema:name>
    <schema:propertyID>inputs_and_states</schema:propertyID>
    <schema:value>Materials/workload: Optical sample/reference in the specified holder and measurement settings.
Other per-input states/guards: not established by this functional summary.
Sources: I product/specification text.</schema:value>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/MIT-M35-0093171348B8"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-property/SW17-M35-0B6C77913DB3%3Ainputs_and_states">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://schema.org/PropertyValue"/>
    <schema:name>Input and input states</schema:name>
    <schema:propertyID>inputs_and_states</schema:propertyID>
    <schema:value>Optical input through the SMA fibre connector; acquisition integration time, averaging and trigger selection from the host PC over USB or serial connection. USB provides power. Normal/free-run, external synchronous, external hardware-level and external hardware-edge triggering are documented. DD4 pin 2 accepts the external TTL trigger (5 or 3.3 V as specified); GPIO pins are not 5 V tolerant. Exact Flame-S/Flame-T detector, slit and wavelength configuration is unspecified in this row.
Source: Manuals/Ocean Optics Flame spectrometer (configuration unspecified)__linked-manual__aa2aa40792.pdf, PDF pp. 12, 15, 21–26, 35, 55, 59–61, 65–67.</schema:value>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/SW17-M35-0B6C77913DB3"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/M20-03">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/ontology#InputOutputProfile"/>
    <dct:identifier>M20-03</dct:identifier>
    <rdfs:label>MTI OTF-1200X — input/output metadata</rdfs:label>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/equipment_io.csv"/>
    <icon:inputDescription>Sample and a suitable process tube; vacuum or flowing gas through the installed flanges. Temperature program contains up to 30 temperature/time segments. Power-lock and furnace relay turn on/off; controller commands enter RUN, HOLD/resume or STOP. The series manual calls for a configured 208–240 V single-phase line in 110 V regions. Gas-pressure limits and atmosphere restrictions must follow the exact tube/flange configuration.
Source: Manuals/MTI OTF-1200X__linked-manual__94143f6f5d.pdf, PDF pp. 4, 8, 11–17, 20–21.</icon:inputDescription>
    <icon:outputDescription>Thermally treated sample; PV display shows current chamber temperature and SV shows the programmed value/state. RUN advances segments; HOLD pauses/resumes; STOP halts the program; relay-off removes heater power. Complete remote-I/O pins are not enumerated in this series manual.
Source: Manuals/MTI OTF-1200X__linked-manual__94143f6f5d.pdf, PDF pp. 4, 8, 11–17, 20–21.</icon:outputDescription>
    <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>°C (process temperature); min and s (profile/timing parameters); °C/min (heating/cooling rate); V and Hz (supply); atm or MPa (tube-pressure restrictions). The pressure restrictions are engineering limits, not proof of a calibrated pressure-output channel.
Source: Manuals/MTI OTF-1200X__linked-manual__94143f6f5d.pdf, PDF pp. 4, 8, 11–17, 20–21.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
    <icon:sourceSha256>c22c4681926fb5b28876a7db7c55d9e527e4ad9fada4ab8774b9aa2b9538bcab</icon:sourceSha256>
    <icon:sourceSheet>Sheet1</icon:sourceSheet>
    <icon:sourceRow>685</icon:sourceRow>
    <icon:sourceModel>MTI OTF-1200X</icon:sourceModel>
    <icon:importedDate>2026-10-30</icon:importedDate>
    <dct:references rdf:resource="https://nano-fab.com/secure/otf-1200x/doc/Manual.pdf"/>
    <dct:references rdf:resource="https://mtixtl.com/products/otf1200x"/>
  </rdf:Description>
