    <rdfs:label>Asylum Research Cypher VRS — input/output metadata</rdfs:label>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/main/catalog/equipment_io.csv"/>
    <icon:inputDescription>Specimen below 15 mm and an AFM probe; scanning/feedback settings. MIT lists liquid imaging/perfusion, applied bias, and heating/cooling (0–250 °C) for its configuration. Mode-specific sample/probe requirements and control-state guards are not enumerated.
Source: I, MIT configuration description and Specifications/Capabilities.</icon:inputDescription>
    <icon:outputDescription>Topography/video images; fast force mapping; ORCA conductive-AFM/current mapping; Young’s modulus, adhesion and storage/loss-modulus mapping in the listed configuration. Acquisition rates are listed up to 625 lines/s, 10 frames/s and 1000 Hz force mapping. Electrical output-state mapping is not supplied.
Source: I, MIT configuration description and Specifications/Capabilities.</icon:outputDescription>
    <icon:measuringUnitsDescription>mm (sample size); lines/s and frames/s (imaging); pixels (image dimensions); Hz (mapping rate); °C (temperature)
Source: I, MIT configuration description and Specifications/Capabilities.</icon:measuringUnitsDescription>
