  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-property/M07-04%3Aoutputs_and_states">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://schema.org/PropertyValue"/>
    <schema:name>Output and output states</schema:name>
    <schema:propertyID>outputs_and_states</schema:propertyID>
    <schema:value>RS-232 commands and responses: 300/1200/2400/9600/19200 baud; up to 100 pumps; states: Commands RUN/STP/PUR; DIS/VER/IN queries; status/error responses; basic or safe communications mode
Dispensed/withdrawn material: Flow follows the configured direction and syringe-dependent rate; states: Infusing, withdrawing or stopped; phase: Fluid; phase/composition depends on loaded sample
Program output, pin 5: User/program-defined logic output; states: LOW or HIGH; OUT 5 {0|1}
Motor-running output, pin 7: RUN.0 or RUN.1 mapping; states: RUN.0 HIGH=pumping, LOW=not pumping; RUN.1 HIGH=pumping or pause timer, LOW=program stopped/paused
Direction output, pin 8: Logic direction indication; states: HIGH=infuse; LOW=withdraw
Dispensed-volume/status response: DIS reports dispensed volume; firmware/status responses available through RS-232; states: Separate infuse/withdraw counters; status responses depend on command and pump state
Buzzer: BUZ controls audible notification; states: Off, continuous, or specified number of beeps</schema:value>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/M07-04"/>
  </rdf:Description>
