    <icon:classification>curator_reviewed_price</icon:classification>
    <icon:scope>Manufacturer online-exclusive offer for exact SKU 50157882. Exact Smart2PurePro16 UV/UF with30L tank bundle SKU50157882,16L/h, each. Official USD17700 list with separate USD15930 online-exclusive discount. Use17700 as list benchmark;15930 is dated online offer, not MSRP. No60L tank or UV-only variant substituted. Current discounted offer is separate from the official list benchmark. Account prices, stock, shipping and taxes may differ.</icon:scope>
