    <dct:identifier>quantel</dct:identifier>
    <rdfs:label>Quantel</rdfs:label>
    <icon:brandIdentityStatus>verified_manufacturer</icon:brandIdentityStatus>
    <icon:researchUseStatus>documented_research_use</icon:researchUseStatus>
    <icon:verificationBasis>independent_research_evidence</icon:verificationBasis>
    <icon:verificationNotes>Lumibird identifies Quantel among its photonics brands. Official group history documents Quantel's 1970 origin, the 2017 Quantel/Keopsys combination and the 2018 Lumibird name. Use Quantel as the historical laser make, with Lumibird as its corporate successor/group. Do not mark the brand defunct merely because the group name changed. Do not conflate scientific Quantel lasers with separate medical-division ownership transactions. Official brand identity and model-specific primary-paper research use checked separately; no adoption-prevalence claim.</icon:verificationNotes>
    <icon:companyStatusNote>Parent / corporate successor: Lumibird. Use Quantel as the historical laser make, with Lumibird as its corporate successor/group. Do not mark the brand defunct merely because the group name changed. Do not conflate scientific Quantel lasers with separate medical-division ownership transactions.</icon:companyStatusNote>
    <icon:reviewDate>2026-10-17</icon:reviewDate>
    <schema:url rdf:resource="https://www.lumibird.com/en/"/>
    <icon:researchEvidenceURL rdf:resource="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3025586/"/>
    <icon:companyStatusSource rdf:resource="https://www.lumibird.com/en/"/>
  </rdf:Description>
