    <icon:associationBasis>Reviewed methods of 10.1016/j.polymdegradstab.2023.110278. Bulk PDMS composite contains 9.5 nm CNTs or 6–10 nm-thick graphene nanoplatelets. Hydrothermal ageing is a later test, not a fabrication stage.</icon:associationBasis>
