Pressure capacity: 500 psi maximum in current model-column specification; states: Pressure is continuous, not an enumerated command state; source conflict requires resolution
Jacket temperature control: Jacketed vessel for external heating/cooling; current family page lists 80 °C maximum; states: External temperature-control configuration; inlet conditions not fully specified; phase: Heat-transfer fluid not specified</schema:value>
