  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/route/P41">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/ontology#Route"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/ontology#ManufacturingProcess"/>
    <dct:identifier>P41</dct:identifier>
    <rdfs:label>Mechanochemical nanocarbon coating and reactive spark-plasma sintering</rdfs:label>
    <skos:notation>P41</skos:notation>
    <icon:associationBasis>Reviewed methods of 10.1016/j.wear.2019.202944. Accepted-manuscript methods inspected. Nanoscale relevance is precursor carbon coating; final TiC is submicron. Hop 2 via the directly cited 2024 review. Curator-added M82–M88 planning alternatives are distinguished from the article-reported apparatus; exact-model compatibility is not established.</icon:associationBasis>
  </rdf:Description>
