    <dct:title>Micro-Photoluminescence Spectroscopy</dct:title>
    <icon:sourceLocator>Single-nanostructure near-IR PL/TRPL setup lists Acton SP2500, Princeton Instrument spectral 2D IR-CCD, 532 nm CW and NKT tunable excitation, 50Ã—/100Ã— NIR objectives, open-cycle Janis/Oxford cryostats and PicoHarp 300. Its detector/excitation/system spectral ranges describe the configured setup, not the standalone spectrograph or TCSPC electronics.</icon:sourceLocator>
