    <schema:name>Input and input states</schema:name>
    <schema:propertyID>inputs_and_states</schema:propertyID>
    <schema:value>Materials/workload: Samples in approved tubes/containers; compatible rotor/buckets and run settings.
Documented parameters/utilities: Temperature setting/range (°C), Electrical supply (A; Hz; V).
Interfaces named: Ethernet, ethernet, USB. Pin directions and permitted commands require the interface section.
Source-described sample/feed form: liquid sample.
Other per-input states/guards: not established by this functional summary.
Sources: H PDF pp. 1, 36, 212.
Additional documented controls/states: lid opening/locking control.
Source: Manuals/Beckman Coulter Optima XPN-100__linked-manual__ce9fefcfaf.pdf, PDF p. 23.</schema:value>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/M14-05"/>
  </rdf:Description>
