  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-property/REQ-EQ-042%3Ainputs_and_states">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://schema.org/PropertyValue"/>
    <schema:name>Input and input states</schema:name>
    <schema:propertyID>inputs_and_states</schema:propertyID>
    <schema:value>End effector and workpiece: Tool/workpiece load within the model payload and center-of-gravity envelope; states: Configured payload and center of gravity; workpiece state depends on attached tool; phase: Not prescribed by robot manual
Control-box digital/safety/configurable inputs: PNP; input voltage −3–30 V; states: OFF region −3–5 V; ON region 11–30 V; 5–11 V is not a valid guaranteed logic region
Control-box analog inputs: Voltage mode 0–10 V or current mode 4–20 mA; 12-bit resolution; states: Voltage/current mode selected in GUI
Tool digital inputs: PNP with weak pull-down; floating input reads LOW; states: LOW ≤2.0 V; HIGH ≥5.5 V within permitted input range −0.5–26 V
Robot motion/program configuration: Joint/TCP moves, payload and tool/installation settings in PolyScope; states: Program/installation dependent; this extract does not enumerate all PolyScope commands or safety functions
Additional documented controls/states: manual/automatic operating mode, remote/local control.
Source: Manuals/Universal Robots UR12e__linked-manual__76e09f695d.pdf, PDF p. 21, 25.</schema:value>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/equipment-io/REQ-EQ-042"/>
  </rdf:Description>
